
# <type>(<scope>): <imperative summary in English, <= 72 chars, no period>
#
# Body: why this change, not what changed.
#       What problem showed up, why this approach, what was ruled out.
#       For git edge cases: write down how to reproduce it.
#
# Footer: BREAKING CHANGE: <migration>   /   Closes #12
#
# ── type ────────────────────────────────────────────
# feat     new feature          fix      bug fix
# perf     performance          refactor no behaviour change
# test     tests only           docs     docs or comments only
# style    formatting only      build    build, deps, signing
# chore    chores               revert   revert a commit
#
# ── scope ───────────────────────────────────────────
# GitKit | AIKit | ForgeKit | App | UI | diff | history | server
# (omit when the change spans modules)
#
# ── forbidden ───────────────────────────────────────
# Any AI co-authorship trailer
# Vacuous summaries: update, fix bug, wip
# Unrelated changes squashed into one commit
#
# Language: commit messages are English. Code comments and docs stay Chinese.
# Full spec: docs/04-工程规范.md §3
